OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly clear
OL,6,Fat first, but areas of mist and fog
OL,7,Fwill develop through the evening,
OL,8,Fparticularly across Lincolnshire, but
OL,9,Fbecoming more widespread later in the
OL,10,Fnight. Chilly, but temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage for the time of year. Light
OL,12,Fwinds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAreas of mist and fog will
OL,15,Fslowly lift and clear through the
OL,16,Fmorning, giving way to sunny spells,
OL,17,Falthough some patches may linger into
OL,18,Fthe afternoon. Fog will redevelop
OL,19,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
