OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Ffurther foggy start with cloud and
OL,7,Fpatchy rain later for Sunday. Fine and
OL,8,Fdry on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average. Turning
OL,10,Fbreezy at times.
